# .graphifyignore — Python (code graph carve-out)
#
# Copied into the repo checkout at build time from the VAULT-side copy at
# graphify/<repo>/.graphifyignore, which is the reviewable, committed one.
# PURE DENYLIST — never add a `!negation` line; negation is not available here.
#
# Scope for this stack is the importable package dir(s). Everything below is
# what "the repo root minus the standard denylist" has to carve back.

# --- environments & dependencies -------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
.tox/
.nox/
site-packages/
vendor/
node_modules/

